    "scenesThatPass": [
      "GRACE: Wait, Anna.\nANNA: Are we taking the truck?",
      "NANCY: You’re in charge of this. Us veterinarians make lousy butchers.\nGRACE: No problem.\nANNA: Can I go outside with Joy?",
      "GRACE: They didn’t come to get you earlier -- they were supposed to come and get you.\nELIZA: We haven’t seen them since we ate.",
      "NANCY: She’s not answering.\nNANCY: Eliza, honey open the door. Open the door, sweetheart -- Oh Jesus -- Break it down! Hurry up!\nELIZA: Fuck you both. Next time you’re going to leave me here alone -- maybe you could try at least telling me where you’re going.\nNANCY: I’m sorry, honey, we thought you were sleeping -- we were at the police station --",
      "ELIZA: What is it?\nNANCY: I told you to feed it! Why didn’t you feed it?!"
    ]
  },
